  "body": "Note, bridge users do not count against MAU. However if your homeserver reaches the MAU limit with real users and then an appservice tries to register ghost users, it will fail with `\"errcode\":\"M_RESOURCE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED\",\"error\":\"Monthly Active User Limit Exceeded\"`\r\n\r\nThis may also be the case for other custom user types too.",
